{"allowed_english": ["XYZ"], "context": {"approved_glossary_entries": [], "neighbor_unit_ids": ["tag:05BG:p008", "tag:05BG:p010"], "policy_revision": "git:40910f342a57c7ad2a90a8b3e3ba629800312e6f", "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "style_guide_path": "config/style-guide.md", "unit_id": "tag:05BG:p009"}, "context_hash": "sha256:3dab49a2874722e206fe02e48cc04abda9d6c99c85ce7e82247fd9ecfc6daabc", "created_at": "2026-08-30T17:08:45+08:00", "glossary_revision": "git:981e3ab307d1aa36f4ba8e0a6ccd78b6f5a641ba", "harness_id": "codex", "harness_version": "0.151.0-alpha.7.2", "model_id": "gpt-5.6-sol", "model_identity_confidence": "owner-confirmed", "model_lane": "openai-gpt-5.6-sol", "model_record_id": "openai:gpt-5.6-sol:owner-confirmed", "model_snapshot": null, "notes": [], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "publication_status": "CANDIDATE", "qa_status": "PASS", "reasoning_effort": "not_exposed", "run_id": "run-20260830-fdl-05bg-gpt56sol-01", "schema_version": 2, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3cfd7fec7d25cbba95fc55af1c730ba662244d01a59fcdd4b5310998e1d18423", "stage": "STRUCTURE_OK", "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Entitled XYZ", "target_term": "题为 XYZ"}, {"source_term": "Acknowledgements", "target_term": "致谢"}, {"source_term": "Dedications", "target_term": "献辞"}, {"source_term": "Endorsements", "target_term": "推荐语"}, {"source_term": "History", "target_term": "历史"}, {"source_term": "Preserve the Title", "target_term": "保留标题"}, {"source_term": "Entitled XYZ", "target_term": "题为 XYZ"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "某个 <BOLDOPEN_0001>“题为 XYZ（Entitled XYZ）”<BOLDCLOSE_0001> 的章节，是指文档中有名称的子单元，其标题要么恰为 XYZ，要么先含有以另一种语言翻译 XYZ 的文字，并紧随其后在括号内含有 XYZ。（此处 XYZ 代表下文提到的某个具体章节名称，例如 <BOLDOPEN_0002>“致谢（Acknowledgements）”<BOLDCLOSE_0002>、<BOLDOPEN_0003>“献辞（Dedications）”<BOLDCLOSE_0003>、<BOLDOPEN_0004>“推荐语（Endorsements）”<BO